{
  "_type": "Project",
  "_id": "XBo8qjwl4TRUKdQP0H6S",
  "name": "Job pipeline - architecture",
  "ownedElements": [
    {
      "_type": "UMLModel",
      "_id": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW",
      "_parent": {
        "$ref": "XBo8qjwl4TRUKdQP0H6S"
      },
      "name": "Architecture",
      "ownedElements": [
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "Wq/Bv45jk00dQjZxRkA1",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "External sources - NoFluffJobs, JustJoin.it, theProtocol.it (PL only, fully remote)",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "hOQFEjt9t18DWs2DsxWF",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "finder = Discovery & Deduplication Agent - crawl/API, normalize, hash + similarity dedupe",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "jvEXIuN5P7Eurgs4M3hJ",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "campaign.jobs - Kafka topic, reference name validated_job_offers, 3 partitions, key companyKey",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "v2oFjqvN5RGjr7AVE0di",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "apply-worker pool - consumer group apply-workers, one record per poll, ack after the Mongo write",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "tUVKULYWSBH+S36dvOXr",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "worker specialisms (reference) - skill/stack, salary/benefit, company/culture checks",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "c0CAfrBFX+xrhTzNeWKN",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "campaign.jobs.dlq - poison messages past maxAttempts -> job_state.status=DEAD",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "ZD8L4P1qP+HlAsL3Bykt",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "mongo-0 = Job Search DB - job_listings, applications, skips, blockers, events, job_state",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "4eS6O40zAiWNT4FitDQ0",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "campaign-api = UI/API - NodePort 30080, /stats /jobs /applications",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "5/oCFmhUd6NhB1uP0bc9",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "Chrome in lubuntu-agent - CDP node IP :30922, used only when APPLY_MODE=live",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLComponent",
          "_id": "g7EPXrqFghrZyMEiqr/b",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "name": "mode switch - APPLY_MODE=shadow, msrouter PAUSED (replicas 0), fallback score 70",
          "visibility": "public"
        },
        {
          "_type": "UMLNote",
          "_id": "d25t/ewMUeN+xiohOD5G",
          "_parent": {
            "$ref": "F+M8VWPuTMifEpSKTMuW"
          },
          "text": "Reference flow vs deployed\nReference: External sources -> Discovery & Deduplication Agent ->\nKafka (validated_job_offers) -> worker agents -> Job Search DB / UI.\nDeployed: finder -> campaign.jobs -> apply-worker pool -> mongo-0 ->\ncampaign-api, with campaign.jobs.dlq for poison messages.\nThe reference names three specialist workers; the deployment runs one\nconsumer group (apply-workers), so parallelism comes from the three\npartitions, not from three services.\nKafka owns delivery, Mongo owns bookkeeping: the offset commits only\nafter the Mongo write succeeds, and a redelivery declines the action."
        },
